# Words after "jours" that make a count of days literal, so "quinze jours
# francs" stays fifteen days rather than the everyday two weeks.
# "Jour franc. Jour entier, de minuit à minuit" (TLFi s.v. "franc", in law);
# a délai in days counts each day (Code de procédure civile, art. 641-642);
# "jours calendaires", "jours pleins", "jours entiers" and "jours de travail"
# name the kind of day counted, as "jours ouvrés" (marker_business.voc) does.
francs
franc
calendaires
calendaire
pleins
plein
entiers
entier
de travail
